WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.561
Spoken communication uses volume, pace, stress, facial expressions and gestures to

00:00:05.561 --> 00:00:06.536
support meaning.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:12.538
A learner rushes and misses small words. What should improve? Answer: Slow to a

00:00:12.538 --> 00:00:14.385
manageable pace and check accuracy.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.485
Describe how a friendly greeting differs from an angry warning.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.460
Discuss why: Accurate pace supports comprehension.
